{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99154","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99154/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99154/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99154/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99154","id":2653719851,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6eLI0r","number":99154,"title":"Smearing border at ogv playback","user":{"login":"andreas-volz","id":16402165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDAyMTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16402165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz","html_url":"https://github.com/andreas-volz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreas-volz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-13T00:16:43Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T18:49:25Z","closed_at":"2024-11-14T18:49:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\nv4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nLinux Mint 21 (Vanessa) - X11 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (nvidia; 535.183.01) - AMD Ryzen 5 2600X Six-Core Processor (12 Threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nI convert a video file to ogv and play in a godot VideoStreamPlayer. It seems to work, but the borders of the video are smearing at the border. It may be a encoder specific issue as I don't have this problem with other videos.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nffmpeg -y -i <file.smk> -codec:v libtheora -qscale:v 31 -codec:a libvorbis -qscale:a 15 -pix_fmt yuv420p <out.ogv>\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\nonly the video. just put into a new project and load into a VideoStreamPlayer\r\n[nlcfid00.ogv.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17724277/nlcfid00.ogv.zip)\r\n\r\nscreenshot broken in Godot:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/431d353f-dd1e-4b4a-96c5-571c2342ad24)\r\n\r\nscreenshot ok in video player application:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eff55538-5f59-4bbd-bf19-9d7dc292079c)\r\n\r\nI made more research and found two things:\r\n1) it seems the minimal automatic detected size in VideoStreamPlayer is 64x64 (real video size is 60x56).\r\n2) even if I encode and scale a (similar) video it detects wrong size: fmpeg -y -i tscfid02.smk -vf scale=120:112 -codec:v libtheora -codec:a libvorbis -pix_fmt yuv420p tscfid02.ogv\r\ngodot size detection is 128x112.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99154/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}